<title>USA: Cotton States Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Cotton States Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>						    1997	  1996</p>
<p> Investment income			1,943,397   1,845,614</p>
<p>Realized investment</p>
<p>  gains						 0	54,284</p>
<p> Total income			     6,417,097   5,762,718</p>
<p> Net earnings			     1,431,300   1,275,972</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>   of common stock			     0.34	  0.30</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of shares used in</p>
<p>computing earnings</p>
<p>   per share				4,267,093   4,245,161</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said 1997 and 1996 per share amounts have been adjusted for a five-for-four stock split on April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Full company name is Cotton States Life Insurance Co.</p>
